OL,3,A'I was not going to let others die' -
OL,4,Apilot of Flydubai flight describes
OL,5,Acockpit attack by co-pilot
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Indian pilot of the Flydubai plane
OL,8,Fwho was stabbed by his co-pilot and
OL,9,Fopened the cockpit door to let others
OL,10,Fin has said he was determined not to
OL,11,Flet others die.
OL,13,FCapt Smit Machchhar said he was on the
OL,14,Ffloor and still being attacked when he
OL,15,Frealised the plane carrying more than
OL,16,F170 passengers was sinking and he had
OL,17,Fto do something.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
