OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'I was not going to let others die' -
OL,4,Apilot of Flydubai flight describes
OL,5,Acockpit attack by co-pilot
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I was lying on the floor injured but I
OL,8,Ftold myself to go for one last push to
OL,9,Fopen the door from inside," he said in
OL,10,Fa video call with Indian Prime Minister
OL,11,FNarendra Modi.
OL,13,F"Others came in and also played a role
OL,14,F[in controlling the situation]. I was
OL,15,Fof course fighting for my own life but
OL,16,Fat the same time I knew I was not going
OL,17,Fto let others die," he added.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
